---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import studies from '../assets/img/practice-7.jpg';
---

<Base title="About" description="Why Loop Master exists: a dedicated place to practice cross-contour lines.">
  <section class="page wrap about">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="label">About us</p>
      <h1 class="title">Mission and Offerings</h1>

      <h2>What We Offer</h2>
      <p>LoopMaster provides a simple yet powerful platform that includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Customizable Practice Sessions:</strong> Set the number of images and timer for your practice
          session to suit your needs.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Feedback Options:</strong> Opt for immediate feedback after each drawing to quickly correct
          mistakes or receive a comprehensive review at the end of the session to see your overall progress.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>New Shapes for Every Practice:</strong> Every time you practice, a new image of shapes is
          generated just for you from our exclusive 3D assets, ensuring a unique experience that allows you to
          explore and refine your artistic skills.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        At LoopMaster, our mission is to help artists develop a deeper understanding of form and structure
        through consistent practice. We believe that consistency is the key to success, and our platform is
        designed to facilitate regular, focused practice sessions that enhance your ability to visualize and
        construct 3D shapes effectively.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Inspiration</h2>
      <p>
        As artists, we saw a gap in resources for practicing 3D form construction. While many platforms focus on
        gesture drawing and basic shapes, few cater to <strong>cross-contour line drawing</strong>, essential for
        visualizing three-dimensional structures. Our daily practice revealed the need for a dedicated platform
        that combines structure and flexibility, enabling artists to enhance their skills effectively.
      </p>

      <p class="signoff">Thank you for choosing LoopMaster.</p>
      <p>
        Let's draw the cross-contour line or loops and unlock the full potential of your illustrations together!
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="/practice/">Start Practicing</a>
    </div>
    <Image class="side" src={studies} alt="An artist draws a torus with cross-contour loops while referencing a tablet" widths={[400, 720]} sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 380px" />
  </section>
  <div class="section"></div>
</Base>

<style>
  .title { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 380px);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .side { width: 100%; border-radius: var(--radius); position: sticky; top: 32px; margin-top: 140px; }
  .signoff { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--step-2); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 2em; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .side { position: static; margin-top: 0; max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
